WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.350
Your people are likely building impressive things with AI, on their own initiative.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.830
Nobody even had to ask.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
And still, you're the one who sees the whole team at once.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.570
It's like a boat with a great crew:

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.390
someone has to steer, or it drifts.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:23.750
That's why you have three roles: setting the roadmap, governing, and managing the change.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:29.750
So first, you see what exists and what you wish for, and decide on each duplicate.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.550
Then you choose use cases by feasibility, value and investment,

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.750
and the AI asks what only you know.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:42.750
And you capture shared knowledge, so everyone's AI starts from one picture.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.930
Then you set the roadmap, and what you expect, allow,

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:48.110
and push further.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.870
So in this adventure, you launch a visual plan the whole team can see.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.930
And you bring everyone along,

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:56.650
then keep steering.
